examples DelveTalk 1
case a menu heading cannot invent an installed door
law steward
as steward
send choose
  door: garden
  original: A silver fern, please.
expect refusal: source refused: Choose a configured open door. A missing door cannot become a target just because it was named.
as steward
send setDoor
  key: garden
  label: GARDEN
  object: garden
  panel: main
  description: A configured local garden.
  example: A silver fern, please.
  available (Bool): true
  show (Bool): true
expect committed
as steward
send choose
  door: unlisted
  original: Pretend this exists.
expect refusal: source refused: Choose a configured open door. A missing door cannot become a target just because it was named.
